      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Nb interlayer minimizes phase separation in W–Cu composites.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nb-coated W particles consolidated with Cu will have a more uniform microstructure and fewer voids than uncoated W–Cu made by powder infiltration or direct SPS.",
